Bhai Mai Luti Aayi Hu, Zainab Ki Sada Hai<br>
rassi Ke Nasha'n Laayi Hu, Zainab Ki Sada Hai<br>
<br>
1. Bazaar Me Balou'n Se Hi Muh Apna Chupakar<br>
<br>
kis Tarah Se Mai Aayi Hu, Zainab Ki Sada Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
2. Dil Seene Me Phat-ta Tha Mera Yaad Me Tere<br>
<br>
ab Jaake Mai Ro Paayi Hu , Zainab Ki Sada Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
3. Pyasi Hi Sakina Mari Zindaan Me Abbas<br>
<br>
usko Mai Sula Aayi Hu, Zainab Ki Sada Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Sunte Hi Tadapne Laga Abbas Ka Laasha<br>
<br>
mai Qaid-e-sitam Paayi Hu , Zainab Ki Sada Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Aik Laash Ki Tarha Tha Khada Abid-e-beemaar<br>
<br>
kis Tarha Utha Laayi Hu , Zainab Ki Sada Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Jo Godh Ke Paale The Woh Sab Thay Sar-e. Naiza<br>
<br>
manzar Bhi Yeh Dekh Aayi Hu , Zainab Ki Sada Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
7. Yeh Kehke Diya Shaam Ke Darbaar Me Khudba<br>
<br>
hasnain Ki Majaayi Hu, Zainab Ki Sada Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
8. Utthi Yeh Najaf qabr Se Shabbir Ki Kehkar<br>
<br>
ab Bhai Mai Bin Bhai Hu, Zainab Ki Sada Hai